        "original_id": "95f483f1-92af-5532-8d20-ce7e85d474d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: OSRIC, Advanced Dungeons & Dragons\n- Concepts: Dungeons & Dragons retro-clones\n- Companies: Wizards of the Coast\n\nFacts:\n- Dungeons & Dragons retro-clones are fantasy role-playing games that seek to emulate editions of Dungeons & Dragons that Wizards of the Coast no longer supports.\n- OSRIC is short for Old School Reference and Index Compilation.\n- OSRIC is a fantasy role-playing game system.\n- OSRIC recreates the first edition of Advanced Dungeons & Dragons.\n- OSRIC is one of the most successful retro-clones.",
